		// Account 1 "authority": Read-only, Signer, Required
		// The router-derived `ccv_signer` PDA the router signs this CPI with, matching
		// `committee-verifier`'s own `authority: Signer` requirement.
		accounts__.Append(solanago.NewAccountMeta(authorityAccount, false, true))
		// Account 2 "remote_chain_config": Read-only, Non-signer, Required
